.TH JSON_PROPERTY_PATH 3
.SH NAME
json_property_path \- follow a path through a JSON tree
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B #include <json.h>
.P
.BI "jsonval json_property_path(jsonval " val ", const char* " path ");"
.SH DESCRIPTION

.BR json_property_path ()
follows a path such as
.B candidates[0].content.parts[0].text
through objects and arrays. A key with dots in it is written as ["a.b"].
.SH RETURN VALUE
The value, or one of the type JSON_UNDEFINED if a step is missing.
.SH SEE ALSO
json_property_get_str(3)
